OL,3,GNEWSATeen says new arthritis injection
OL,4,Ais life-changing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who used to take six tablets
OL,7,Fa week and was sick all the time says a
OL,8,Fnew injection has stopped her flare ups
OL,9,Fand nausea.
OL,11,FAnnabelle, 17, from Bristol, has the
OL,12,Finjections fortnightly and said it
OL,13,Fmeans she can play sport again despite
OL,14,Fliving with juvenile idiopathic
OL,15,Farthritis (JIA).
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
