OL,3,GNEWSATeen says new arthritis injection
OL,4,Ais life-changing
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe has is one of many patients
OL,7,Ftrialling new treatments at Bristol
OL,8,FRoyal Hospital for Children, which is
OL,9,Fpart of an international effort to
OL,10,Fdevelop new drugs and find a cure for
OL,11,Fthe condition, which causes swollen and
OL,12,Fstiff joints.
OL,14,F"If there's a cure that would be very
OL,15,Fgood because I'm not sure I'll ever get
OL,16,Foff my medication," said Annabelle.
